 "remarks": "Welcome to 377 Glenbrook Road Unit 3, a beautifully maintained and spacious condominium offering two levels of comfortable living in a convenient Stamford location. Step inside to find a bright and inviting main level featuring gleaming luxury vinyl floors, a cozy wood fireplace, and an open flow between the living and dining areas perfect for both everyday living and entertaining. The dining space opens seamlessly to a private patio, creating an ideal indoor-outdoor lifestyle for relaxing or hosting guests. The completely updated kitchen is thoughtfully laid out with ample cabinetry and workspace, making meal prep both functional and enjoyable. Upstairs, the primary suite offers a peaceful retreat complete with its own private balcony, full bath, and generous closet space, while an additional bedroom provide flexibility for guests, home office, or additional living needs. This well appointed unit combines comfort and convenience with assigned parking, access to nearby shopping, dining, and public transportation, and a highly walkable location. A rare opportunity to enjoy multi level living with both patio and balcony spaces in one of Stamford's most accessible neighborhoods.",
